{
  "key": "UnityMCP",
  "is_engine": true,
  "order": 1,
  "displayName": "Unity Biome MCP",
  "instruction": "Unity Biome MCP: requires Unity 6 (6000.0+) and uv. Install the Unity package from the git URL https://github.com/german-krasnikov/unity-biome-mcp.git?path=unity-plugin, then run MCP > Setup Wizard in Unity. The Unity Editor must be running - the server discovers the Editor port through ~/.unity-biome-mcp/ports/*.port, so no env vars are needed. Only 38 of 163 tools are visible up front; the rest are unlocked per category via discover_tools.",
